---
import HeroIntroduction from './HeroIntroduction.astro';
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-heading">
    <HeroIntroduction />
    <h1 class="hero-wordmark">
    <img src="/sreejita.svg" alt="Sreejita" />
    </h1>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-bottom" id="profile">
    <div class="hero-bottom__label"><span>01 / ABOUT ME</span><span>SOFTWARE ENGINEERING<br />&amp; CREATIVE DEVELOPMENT</span></div>
    <div class="hero-manifesto">
      <div class="hero-about-grid">
        <h2>Ideas into code.<br /><span>Curiosity into something real.</span></h2>
        <div class="profile-intro">
        <p>I’m Sreejita, an Immersive Software Engineering student at the University of Limerick. I enjoy turning complex ideas into things people can actually use.</p>
        <p>What draws me to software is the combination of problem-solving, creativity and teamwork. I like understanding how something works, figuring out where it can be better, and working through the details that bring an idea to life.</p>
        <p>Outside university, I experiment with web projects, game ideas and interactive experiences — especially ones with a little personality.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-focus"><span class="label">AREAS OF INTEREST</span><p>Software engineering <span> / </span> Interactive experiences <span> / </span> Product thinking</p></div>
      <a href="#work">Explore my projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


